      "content": "Wait, what? I'm not sure I follow the goblin analogy. I'm just trying to fix a production bug. \n\nCan we stick to the technical side? You mentioned the deadlock and the state machine error. Can you explain exactly how the transaction pool deadlock would lead to that 'unexpected state in state_machine_v2' error? Is there a specific sequence of events in the code that would cause that?",
